# PyArrow: Zero-Copy Memory Sharing IPC
direction: right

disk: "Parquet on NVMe SSD"
arrow: "Shared PyArrow Table in RAM\n• Arrow RecordBatch (0x7FFF0042)\n• Standardized columnar memory"
polars: "Polars Engine\n• pl.from_arrow()\n• Zero-copy pointer bind"
duckdb: "DuckDB SQL\n• Direct buffer scan\n• Zero-copy SQL execution"

